working through the issues you've reported:New- Pets at Home can now be long-pressed and dragged to a new spotImproved- Improved in-game sound effects- Improved the visual effect while an AI building is being generated- Improved the animations on the pet creation a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:28:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031263","verified_at":"2026-10-22T10:08:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4437020-1846651706693862","game_id":"steam-4437020","kind":"announcement","title":"欢迎所有人的反馈！我们正在收集大家的反馈进行每日更新！Welcome everyone's feedback!","summary":"QQ群：1091641168 Discord: https://discord.gg/5zvYQvSsA 【更新公告】新增- 家园 AI 建筑入口常驻显示，宠物界面可直接进入创造和合成- AI 建筑生成时，生成按钮会隐藏，改为显示后台生成提示- AI 生成宠物或建筑失败时，会提示具体原因（内容敏感或网络问题）- 宠物头顶气泡改为文字表情，宠物有专属台词- 宠物详情、合成、创造完成界面支持拖动旋转模型，预览镜头会按宠物身高自动取景- 技能合成结束后，默认展开技能说明- 家园任务增加指路表现，任务栏交互更顺手- 新增每日排行榜，排行榜接入 Steam- 游戏音效更新优化- 宠物蛋界面没有蛋时，会显示提示文案- 家园右下角按钮文字改为「AI建筑」，字更大更醒目- 道具拾取体验优化- 宠物头像、天赋激活按钮等图片更清晰修复- 修复删除建筑后无法重新建造、提示已达数量上限的问题- 修复打包版过门进入下一章后，转场遮罩不消失的问题- 修复点击 AI 建筑按钮时镜头会旋转的问题- 修复首次进入游戏时，暂停界面无法回到家园的问题- 修复打开星愿蛋界面却显示建筑界面的问题 【Update Notes】N","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:10:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693862","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:07:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4437020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:35Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:35Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4437020":"2026-10-26T12:29:35Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4437020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:35Z"},"5294350":